     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi 秉蒲,</div><div><br></div><div>參考以下內容:</div><div><br></div><div>?hist 結果中, x a vector of values for which the histogram is desired. 表示 x 為向量, 不可為 data.frame</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#800\"># 主題: hist直方圖</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#800\"># date: 2019.5.22</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">trees</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">trees</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Height&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">hist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">trees</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Height&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># ERROR</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#800\">class(trees[&#39;Height&#39;]) # data.frame</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">class</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">trees$Height</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># numeric 表示向量</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#800\">hist(trees$Height) # hist須使用向量方式輸入,結果可以繪圖</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#800\"># end</span></div></div></code></div><br><br></div>王秉蒲於 2019年5月21日星期二 UTC+8下午11時34分17秒寫道：</div>"
