     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">原來如此，感謝!!<div><br></div><div>另外，可否再問一下，</div><div>今天我打</div><div>data() 時會一直出現In file.show(outFile, delete.file = TRUE, title = paste(&quot;R&quot;, tolower(x$title))) :的訊息，原本我在桌機上不會有這種情況，但筆電就會有。網上有說是路徑包含中文的關係，但我把全部檔案改成英文後還是沒有解決。這邊您知道怎麼辦嗎? 謝謝!</div><div><br>在 2019年5月22日星期三 UTC+8下午12:56:28，WEPA ^_^写道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>使用 unlist 即可轉換為向量:<br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">hist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">unlist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">trees</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Height&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]))</span></div></code></div><br>王秉蒲於 2019年5月22日星期三 UTC+8上午9時37分21秒寫道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">那我有辦法將trees[&#39;Height&#39;&#39;]轉換成numeric形式嗎?<br><br>在 2019年5月22日星期三 UTC+8上午9:03:26，WEPA ^_^写道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi 秉蒲,</div><div><br></div><div>參考以下內容:</div><div><br></div><div>?hist 結果中, x a vector of values for which the histogram is desired. 表示 x 為向量, 不可為 data.frame</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#800\"># 主題: hist直方圖</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#800\"># date: 2019.5.22</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">trees</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">trees</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Height&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">hist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">trees</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Height&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># ERROR</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#800\">class(trees[&#39;Height&#39;]) # data.frame</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">class</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">trees$Height</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># numeric 表示向量</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#800\">hist(trees$Height) # hist須使用向量方式輸入,結果可以繪圖</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#800\"># end</span></div></div></code></div><br><br></div>王秉蒲於 2019年5月21日星期二 UTC+8下午11時34分17秒寫道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">大家好，小弟我目前自學中，有個基礎的問題，希望板上可以解惑一下<div><br></div><div>我用</div><div>data()</div><div>trees</div><div>做練習</div><div><br></div><div>想用 trees[&#39;Height&#39;] 做 hist 圖表</div><div>但他一直顯示 is not numeric</div><div>這種情況應該怎麼轉換資料呢?</div></div></blockquote></div></blockquote></div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div>"
